-- Combo tee sets for Red / Blue / Black — the three combination tees the resort's
-- 2021 scorecards publish alongside the four base tees (Green, Black, Silver, Gold).
--
-- The original tee seed (20260812100500_seed_tees.sql) left these out, believing the
-- per-hole yardages weren't recoverable. They are: the card's single "Combo" row of
-- ▲/▼ triangles gives them for ALL THREE combos at once — ▲ = the back tee of the pair,
-- ▼ = the forward tee (Kyle 2026-08-22, "it's where the arrow points on the card"). So
-- Green/Black reads Green on ▲ / Black on ▼, Black/Silver reads Black/Silver, Silver/Gold
-- reads Silver/Gold — one arrow pattern per course, three combos off it.
--
-- SOURCE: the hand-verified 2021 scorecards (Red / Blue / Black), Kyle 2026-08-22.
--   Gentlemen rating / slope / total per combo:
--     Red    Green/Black 73.0/136/6831  Black/Silver 70.6/128/6250  Silver/Gold 65.9/114/5309
--     Blue   Green/Black 72.9/132/6934  Black/Silver 70.7/129/6381  Silver/Gold 67.5/120/5796
--     Black  Green/Black 73.2/132/6981  Black/Silver 70.8/127/6462  Silver/Gold 67.1/120/5681
--   Par is the course par on every tee (Red/Blue 72, Black 73).
--
-- Every combo's 18 derived hole yardages were checked to sum to the card's printed combo
-- total before seeding (scripts/gen — all nine reconcile to the cent). Arrow rows used:
--   Red   ▼▼▲▲▲▲▼▲▼ / ▼▲▼▼▲▼▼▲▲
--   Blue  ▲▲▼▼▲▲▼▼▼ / ▲▼▲▲▲▲▼▼▼
--   Black ▲▲▼▼▼▲▼▲▼ / ▲▼▲▼▲▲▼▲▼
--
-- Tee stable-UUID scheme (extends the base seed): bbbb000C-0000-4000-8000-00000000000T
--   C = course (1 Red / 2 Blue / 3 Black); T = 5 Green/Black, 6 Black/Silver, 7 Silver/Gold.

-- ─── Combo tees (rating / slope / par / total per course) ────────────────────
on conflict (id) do nothing;

-- ─── Combo per-hole yardages (derived from each course's ▲/▼ Combo row) ───────
on conflict (hole_id, tee_id) do nothing;
